// Chapter 12 (post-game): the door of Antenna Eta (MAP_ROUTE_S07_ANTENNE, 12-post-game.md section 4.3).
[
    // The old Cocket relay: a gate like the Secteur Eta's (SilRouteS07's G H I / J P K, 537-542) on the void
    // above the Pile du Milieu's deck (17-19, 21-22), its passage (18, 22) (541, MB_NON_ANIMATED_DOOR),
    // entered from the deck (18, 23) by walking north. Arriving from the antenna walks the player south onto
    // (18, 23).
    Ascii(x: 17, y: 21, rows: ["GHI", "JPK"], legend: {'G': (metatile: 537, collision: 1, elevation: 3), 'H': (metatile: 538, collision: 1, elevation: 3), 'I': (metatile: 539, collision: 1, elevation: 3), 'J': (metatile: 540, collision: 1, elevation: 3), 'P': (metatile: 541, collision: 0, elevation: 3), 'K': (metatile: 542, collision: 1, elevation: 3)}),
    // Warp 3: the passage, to the antenna's mats (its warp 0).
    Warp(x: 18, y: 22, dest_map: "RouteS07_Antenne", dest_warp: 0),
]
